        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "All overtime is at the discretion of each station's management and is independent of other stations. If additional overtime is required at a station, the station Management will first solicit overtime from the Assistants at the originating location. If additional overtime is required, at the discretion of station Management, management may solicit overtime assistance from Assistants at other stations.",
